  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Experience EU  - Education, People-to-People and Alumni work in the United States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims at strengthening the bonds between the citizens of the United States and the European Union through Education Outreach, People-to-People (P2P) and Alumni activities. The project will organise activities for US citizens, above all pupils, students, teachers and targeted professionals, to support their learning and teaching about the EU and experiencing the EU by creating direct contacts with EU representatives, experts and citizens</narrative>
  </description>
